Optional whole nginx server blocks (http context) for a separate admin-UI hostname (v1.3d, SSO_ADMIN_UI_HOSTNAME).
Copy example.conf.sample to e.g. admin-host.conf, replace the host name and cert files (nginx's envsubst only
renders the main template, so write literal values here). Only *.conf files are included. Also set
SSO_ADMIN_UI_HOSTNAME and add the name to SSO_ALLOWED_HOSTS; Django then serves the UI only on that Host.
